# Outfit gear (R18): a field radio on the back, glowing dial panel, steel knobs, a long whip antenna with a glowing
# tip and an accent handset clipped to the side. Back frame as outfit_backpack (pivot 4 3 2).
name outfit_radio
grid 5
size 4 7 16
slot radio SwatchMain
slot panel SwatchGlow
slot knob Steel
slot handset SwatchAccent
box 0 0 0 4 6 7 radio
paint box 0 1 4 1 4 6 panel
box 0 4 2 1 5 3 knob
box 0 1 2 1 2 3 knob
box 1 6 1 3 7 5 handset
box 1 4 7 2 5 15 knob
box 1 4 15 2 5 16 panel
pivot 4 3 2
